 1. Testing Activities – Instagram

I would choose **Instagram** for this example.

| Testing Activity         | What it checks                                                                  |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 1. Functional Testing    | Checks whether the new feature works correctly according to the requirements.   |
| 2. UI Testing            | Checks whether buttons, icons, text, and screens are displayed properly.        |
| 3. Compatibility Testing | Checks whether the feature works on different devices and operating systems.    |
| 4. Performance Testing   | Checks whether the app remains fast and responsive while using the new feature. |
| 5. Security Testing      | Checks whether user data and account information are properly protected.        |
| 6. Regression Testing    | Checks that the new feature has not affected existing Instagram features.       |

