2. RACI Chart – Shopping Cart Feature

**R = Responsible, A = Accountable, C = Consulted, I = Informed**

| Activity         | Tester | Test Leader | Developer | Product Owner |
| ---------------- | ------ | ----------- | --------- | ------------- |
| Test Planning    | R      | A           | C         | I             |
| Test Case Design | R      | A           | C         | C             |
| Test Execution   | R      | A           | C         | I             |
| Bug Reporting    | R      | A           | C         | I             |

**Simple explanation:** The Tester does most of the actual testing work, while the Test Leader manages and approves the testing activities. The Developer helps with technical issues, and the Product Owner provides requirements and stays updated about progress.

---

3. Job Description – Test Leader

A **Test Leader** manages the testing activities for the new BookMyShow movie booking feature. They assign testing tasks to team members and monitor daily testing progress. They review test cases and bug reports and help decide which issues should be fixed first. They also coordinate with developers and the Product Owner to decide whether the feature is ready for release.

