 4. Testing Activities for Dark Mode

| Testing Activity         | Performed By | What it involves                                                                        |
| ------------------------ | ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 1. Test Planning         | Test Leader  | Decides the testing scope, resources, and schedule for the Dark Mode feature.           |
| 2. Test Case Design      | Tester       | Creates test cases for turning Dark Mode ON and OFF and checking its behavior.          |
| 3. Functional Testing    | Tester       | Checks whether the Dark Mode toggle works correctly throughout the app.                 |
| 4. UI Testing            | Tester       | Checks whether text, icons, buttons, and backgrounds look correct in Dark Mode.         |
| 5. Compatibility Testing | Tester       | Checks Dark Mode on different devices and supported operating systems.                  |
| 6. Test Review           | Test Leader  | Reviews test results and makes sure important areas have been properly tested.          |
| 7. Release Decision      | Test Leader  | Reviews major bugs and decides whether the feature is ready from a testing perspective. |
